    58	
    59	Cael had him catalogued before he sat. Fifty, or a road's version of fifty. A face weather had done most of the work on. Hands that had learned exactly two things, a rein and a wheel, and had stopped taking on new ones. A way of standing that kept his mule between himself and anything he had not priced yet, which at present was the five of them. The mule looked at Brom, because animals looked at Brom.
