   241	*Claim: there is something out here that hunts Paths. Evidence: one mile, one buckle, a hundred paces of gravel it would not cross, and a man who has walked that road for twenty years and hires crews for what they don't do. Ruling: hold — and write the claim down anyway, because I have been not-using mine in front of hostile audiences since I was fifteen, and four institutions marked me down for it, and a valley just priced it as the only competence on the road. Turns out that was training for this.*
